# # /dredto/
#
# Identifier for DREDTO, the Ontology of cyberdiseases - diseases resulting
# from exposure to digital technologies (ITPCC).
#
# The ontology IRI is https://w3id.org/dredto and its terms are hash IRIs,
# e.g. https://w3id.org/dredto#SomeTerm. The fragment is never sent to the
# server, so only the ontology IRI itself needs a redirect.
#
# - Clients asking for OWL/XML are sent to the ontology file hosted by ITPCC:
#   https://www.itpcc.pl/research/cyberdiseases-ontology/dredto.owx
# - Everyone else (browsers, */*, no Accept header) is sent to the ontology
#   page on BioPortal: https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/DREDTO
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Paweł Barczyk
# pjbarczyk@gmail.com
# GitHub username: PJBarczyk

RewriteEngine on

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/owl\+xml
RewriteRule ^$ https://www.itpcc.pl/research/cyberdiseases-ontology/dredto.owx [R=303,L]

RewriteRule ^ https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/DREDTO [R=303,L]
